1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:03,280
(Sheldon:)Of course it is.
It's the perfect gift.

2
00:00:03,279 --> 00:00:04,749
H-How are you feeling right now?

3
00:00:04,748 --> 00:00:07,178
(Sheldon:)Guilty? Sad?

4
00:00:07,183 --> 00:00:09,253
(Sheldon:)Wishing you were Jewish?

5
00:00:10,387 --> 00:00:12,357
(Amy:)No, I love it.

6
00:00:12,355 --> 00:00:13,585
(Sheldon:)Oh, really?

7
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:15,420
(Sheldon:)Well, how about now?

8
00:00:15,425 --> 00:00:17,055
(Christmas music playing)

9
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:20,230
SHELDON (recorded):
Happy holidays to my dear Amy.

10
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:23,260
(Sheldon:)I hope you treasure this

11
00:00:23,266 --> 00:00:27,266
(Sheldon:)as much as I treasure you.
(mouthing)

12
00:00:28,371 --> 00:00:30,301
(Sheldon:)And you got me nothing.

13
00:00:31,574 --> 00:00:33,444
(Sheldon:)Christmas is ruined.

14
00:00:33,443 --> 00:00:35,173
(Sheldon:)Let's never speak of it again.

15
00:00:35,612 --> 00:00:38,142
(Sheldon:)Well, this was fun.

16
00:00:38,148 --> 00:00:39,818
(Raj:)Actually,

17
00:00:39,816 --> 00:00:42,486
(Amy:)I did get you
something.

18
00:00:42,485 --> 00:00:45,625
(Sheldon:)But what about our agreement?

19
00:00:45,622 --> 00:00:48,352
(Amy:)Well, you got me
something. Here.

20
00:00:52,429 --> 00:00:54,299
(Sheldon:)Cookies?

21
00:00:54,297 --> 00:00:56,967
(Amy:)They're your Meemaw's
Christmas cookies.

22
00:00:56,966 --> 00:01:09,026
(Amy:)I called and got
the recipe.

